# Netlify Single-Page Application (SPA) Redirects
# Docs: https://docs.netlify.com/routing/redirects/rewrites-proxies/#history-pushstate-and-single-page-apps

# 1. Decap CMS Admin panel routes (direct static file serving)
/admin        /admin/index.html   200
/admin/*      /admin/:splat       200

# 2. SPA catch-all rewrite rule for all client-side routes
# Returns HTTP 200 (rewrite, not redirect) so browser URL remains intact
/*            /index.html         200
